  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RoundTransitionUI
  rootPanel: {fileID: 910130000000010}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 910130000000014}
  messageText: {fileID: 910130000000033}
  winOneLinerText: {fileID: 0}
  lossOneLinerText: {fileID: 0}
  continueButton: {fileID: 1586225055}
  continueButtonGroup: {fileID: 1586225056}
  optOutToggle: {fileID: 910130000000075}
  optOutToggleLabel: {fileID: 910130000000103}
  optOutToggleGroup: {fileID: 910130000000072}
  contentRoot: {fileID: 910130000000021}
  actionRoot: {fileID: 910130000000041}
  lossOneLinerSpacer: {fileID: 0}
  transitionFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1470b117e5ec7a4c9c2c4151211f423, type: 2}
  continueButtonPrefab: {fileID: 6826685574233894395, guid: 5e7f2b5277a37d041a57b07dbb619341, type: 3}
  winOneLiners:
  - Castle cleared. On to the next one.
  - This is definitley going on my next job application.
  - One less wall between you and legendary status.
  - Hide in your shell little turtles, the horde will crack you open.
  - Easy breezy.
  - GG EZ.
  - If that's the best they've got, this will be a breeze.
  - Watch them flee like scared little turtles.
  - Has anyone gotten paid yet?
  - I can't help but think this was only possible because of my greatness.
  - I'm feeling stronger already!
  - I'm going to see blocks falling when I close my eyes.
  - "Humans call it architecture\u2026 We call it target practice."
  - Nice castle. Now it's rubble.
  - Womp Womp.
  - I am THEE Tetrabeast.
  - Bigger walls, same fate.
  - How to unalive a castle 101.
  - Is anyone else hungry. I could really go for some BBQ.
  - Another tower bites the dust.
  - Smash. Stack. Destroy. Repeat.
  - I hope they got the warranty for that castle.
  - The hounds will feast tonight.
  - Time to turn more big rocks into little rocks.
  - Tuck your tails little turtles, I'm coming for you!
  - "Humanity\u2019s greatest walls\u2026 now a parking lot."
  - How many times do we gotta teach you this lesson old man?
  - If you didn't want us to break it, then you should have made it more durable.
  - Is it really economical to build this many castles?
  - Where are all these squirrels coming from?
  - Can we take five? I have rubble in places it really shouldn't be.
  - Can someone explain why the shopkeeper keeps trying to give me plates of spaghetti?
  - If I never see another block again it will be too soon.
  - My fingers hurt, but champions perservere.
  - Do you think Lillith is single?
  - Do you think commander Bosco would let me rub his belly?
  - Can't stop, won't stop.
  - At what point does this become bullying?
  - Silly little turtles, your stone shells will all crumble before our might.
  - Tonight we will feast on turtle soup!
  - We fight for peace and it's going to be very peaceful once you're all dead.
  - How many turtles does it take to defend a castle? More than this clearly.
  - The bigger they are, the more we get to destroy.
  lossOneLiners:
  - Regroup. Rebuild. Return stronger.
  - The conquest pauses here.
  - One failed push is not the end.
  - Fine, keep your secrets little turtles.
  - Dust off the roster and try again.
  - Just wait until my big bro is home.
  - Games broken.
  - These turles have tougher shells than expected.
  - Next time we use the big bombs.
  - I zigged when I should have zagged.
  - '"Sign up for the front line" they said... "It will be exciting" they said...'
  - Your shells will not protect you forever little turtles.
  - Just wait until I get back from Gabba Ghoul's Goods.
  - That escalated quickly...
  - If at first you don't succeed, blow everything up.
  - The battle is over, but not the war.
  - Without your shells, you soft belly turtles will be crushed easily.
  - Maybe next time we strategize.
  - Notes on the battle, maybe die less?
  - That was an excellent demonstration of what not to do.
  - We will grab you turtles by your tails and rip you from your shells.
  - No more mister nice monster.
  - Thanks Obama.
  - 'Grandpa I don''t wanna break castles no more.

    Well that''s too damn bad!'
  transitionAnimator: {fileID: 978409729}
  fireworkAnimationRoot: {fileID: 978409730}
